# Template for the one secret this tool needs. This file documents the variable name
# only; never put a real value in the repo.
#
# The real file lives in Ethan's space, where the dev account cannot read it at rest:
#   ~/.config/playlist-player/secrets.env   (mode 600, hand-maintained)
#
# Only the tracklist fetch (scripts/fetch-tracklist.sh) reads it, once per playlist.
# Lyrics, audio, playback and the overlay need no secret.

# Apify API token. Apify Console -> Settings -> API & Integrations.
APIFY_TOKEN=
